<title>SWEDEN: Momentum says Swedish pulp stocks flat in Feb.</title>
<headline>Momentum says Swedish pulp stocks flat in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish pulpstocks were nearly unchanged in February, the Swedish pulp and paper consultancy company Momentum said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;I have just made calculations on the stocks in Sweden...they are nearly unchanged, perhaps a change of plus or minus 5,000 tonnes,&quot; Momentum's president Bernt Stenberg told Reuters.</p>
<p>NorScan data on North American and Scandinavian pulp stocks are expected to be released during the next few days.</p>
<p>-- Olle Lindstrom, Stockholm Newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
